# Prisma CLI overrides for this package. The committed workflow reads
# DATABASE_URL/DIRECT_URL from the repository-root `.env` (see package.json
# scripts), so this file is optional and never committed with real
# credentials. Point both at the same Neon branch (pooled + direct):
# DATABASE_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xyz-pooler.REGION.aws.neon.tech/apteez?sslmode=require&pgbouncer=true&connection_limit=10
# DIRECT_URL=postgresql://USER:PASSWORD@ep-xyz.REGION.aws.neon.tech/apteez?sslmode=require
